- Include headers: GameEngine.h, GameConfig.h, Random.h.
- Test 1: Bird physics: after a flap and a few steps, birdY increases initially, then decreases due to gravity; assert monotonic behaviors at specific ticks.
- Test 2: Scoring: simulate enough ticks with periodic flaps to avoid crash; assert score increments when a pipe passes.
- Optional Test 3: Collision and reset: force no flaps and high gravity to collide; assert gameOver becomes true, then reset returns to gameOver false and score zero.

